Attackers use stolen credentials to create new access keys:
```bash
aws iam create-access-key --user-name "admin"  # New key for persistence
```
Detection: AWS Config rules:
```json
{
  "ConfigRule": {
    "Source": {
      "Owner": "AWS",
      "SourceIdentifier": "iam-user-unused-credentials"
    }
  }
}
```
Mitigation: Enforce least privilege, rotate keys automatically (AWS Lambda).

